<view class="hero" style="padding:48rpx 40rpx 100rpx">
  <view class="eyebrow">RESERVATION</view>
  <view class="title" style="font-size:46rpx">在线预订</view>
  <view class="desc">填写入住信息，提交后即锁定房间</view>
</view>

<view class="container" style="margin-top:-60rpx">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title" style="font-size:30rpx">预订信息</view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">门店</view>
      <picker range="{{stores}}" range-key="name" value="{{storeIndex}}" bindchange="onStore">
        <view class="picker">{{ stores[storeIndex].name || '请选择门店' }}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">房型</view>
      <picker range="{{types}}" range-key="label" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="onType">
        <view class="picker">{{ types[typeIndex].label || '请选择房型' }}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="grid-2">
      <view class="field">
        <view class="label">入住</view>
        <picker mode="date" value="{{form.checkIn}}" start="{{today}}" bindchange="onCheckIn">
          <view class="picker">{{ form.checkIn }}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <view class="label">离店</view>
        <picker mode="date" value="{{form.checkOut}}" start="{{form.checkIn}}" bindchange="onCheckOut">
          <view class="picker">{{ form.checkOut }}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">房间数</view>
      <picker range="{{[1,2,3]}}" value="{{form.roomCount - 1}}" bindchange="onRoomCount">
        <view class="picker">{{ form.roomCount }} 间</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-line"><text>可订房量</text><text>{{ available === null ? '待查询' : available + ' 间' }}</text></view>
    <view class="summary-line"><text>参考单价</text><text>¥{{ unitPrice }} / 晚</text></view>
    <view class="summary-line"><text>预计总价</text><text>¥{{ total }}</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title" style="font-size:30rpx">入住人信息</view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">姓名</view>
      <input class="input full" placeholder="请填写真实姓名" value="{{form.guestName}}" data-field="guestName" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">手机号</view>
      <input class="input full" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="用于接收确认信息" value="{{form.guestPhone}}" data-field="guestPhone" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">身份证号</view>
      <input class="input full" placeholder="入住登记与公安报送需要，加密存储" value="{{form.idNo}}" data-field="idNo" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">协议单位（选填）</view>
      <input class="input full" placeholder="企业协议客户可填写" value="{{form.company}}" data-field="company" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">备注</view>
      <textarea class="input" placeholder="如高楼层、安静房间、预计到店时间" value="{{form.remark}}" data-field="remark" bindinput="onInput"></textarea>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="muted" style="padding:0 8rpx 20rpx;line-height:1.8">
    提交即表示同意《入住须知》与《隐私政策》。证件信息仅用于入住登记与合规报送。
  </view>
</view>

<view class="footer-space"></view>
<view class="footer-bar">
  <view>
    <view class="price">¥{{ total }}</view>
    <view class="muted">{{ nights }} 晚 · {{ form.roomCount }} 间</view>
  </view>
  <button class="btn" style="width:300rpx" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交预订</button>
</view>
